    "api_error_status": null,
    "result": "## Bug Fixed \u2713\n\nThe issue was in how the frai CLI passed arguments to the frai-gate subprocess. Commander.js separates positional arguments from flags when parsing, and the action handler was only receiving the positional arguments\u2014the `--ci` flag was being discarded.\n\n**The fix:** Changed line 753 in `/packages/frai-cli/src/index.ts` to use `process.argv.slice(3)` instead of the `args` parameter, which bypasses commander's parsing and passes the complete command line to the frai-gate subprocess.\n\n**Verification:** After rebuilding with `pnpm --filter frai build`, running `frai gate init --ci` now correctly creates both `FRAI-SPEC.md` and `.github/workflows/rai-gate.yml`.",
